//! femtopython: a small, strictly-typed, embeddable subset of Python.
//!
//! The entry point is [`Interpreter`]. Source text goes through a full
//! recognition pipeline before anything executes: a regular lexer (plus a
//! bounded indentation stack), an LR(1) parser generated by lalrpop, and a
//! static checker. Evaluation is bounded by the limits in [`Config`].

